  "bio": "Caro Ley is a talented tattoo artist based in Berlin, Germany, specializing in sketch, minimalist, and fineline styles. Known for her radically tender approach to tattooing, Caro maintains a sparkling clean and meticulously organized workspace, promoting a sense of tranquility and safety, underpinning her trauma-aware care approach. She exudes an unparalleled level of professionalism in all facets of her craft.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Berlin, Berlin, Germany\n\ncaroleytattoo@gmail.com\nbased in Hamburg/Germany\nside project: @radicallytender \nNewsletter:",
